    "title": "📅 Cumberland County Career Fair April 17 with On-Site Applications - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago Cumberland County Government will hold a career fair on Friday, April 17, from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. at the North Regional Library, 855 McArthur Road in Fayetteville . The event connects local residents with county job openings and career paths.\nAttendees can meet with representatives from several county departments, get resume-writing help , and even apply for jobs on-site . A free clothing closet will also be available with professional attire like suits, dresses, and shoes for those who need them.\nCumberland County offers competitive pay, benefits, and employee support programs. For details on current openings, visit cumberlandcountync.gov/jobs .\nMore Info: County Hosting Career Fair April 17\n3",
    "summary": "9 hours ago Cumberland County Government will hold a career fair on Friday, April 17, from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. at the North Regional Library, 855 McArthur Road in Fayetteville . The event connects local residents with county job openings and career paths. Attendees can meet with representatives from several county departments, get resume-writing help , and even apply for jobs on-site . A free clothing closet will also be available with professional attire like suits, dresses, and shoes for those who need them. Cumberland County offers competitive pay, benefits, and employee support programs.",
